{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Forehead Chip</strong></i><strong> </strong>is a narrative cyberpunk <strong>platformer</strong> set in the midst of Arca City, a fracturing utopia. You\u2019ve joined the <strong>Implant Corps </strong>to restore order by capturing vile <strong>Holdouts</strong>. Use clever weapons, upgrades, and implant tech to stay on top, or dig deep into the city\u2019s secrets and tensions at your peril<strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/4bed930cccad240457884e6874fb10a6.webp?t=1757471368\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/e24b655e630df285f770db6b423ada61.poster.avif?t=1757471368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/e24b655e630df285f770db6b423ada61.webm?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/e24b655e630df285f770db6b423ada61.mp4?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about maintaining <i>order.</i> And it\u2019s your job to capture Holdouts. So you need to know the drill:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your supply</strong> of implant bullets in <strong>tactical combat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just destroy your enemies - <strong>capture them!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of distinctively controlled <strong>weapons and ammo.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and upgrade</strong> your arsenal until you hit that perfect combination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuse your ammo </strong>and inject<strong> logic</strong> <strong>capsules</strong> that affect their behaviour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to ask your <strong>Sergeant</strong> and <strong>Commander</strong> for tips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/abdaa908eb06c8c89f064e4d2e6c8ea2.webp?t=1757471368\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.poster.avif?t=1757471368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.webm?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/20fa0eb62197ad8b2ea4e59cf13fe3ce.mp4?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an\u00a0<strong>unfolding narrative</strong> where your choices affect gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as young <strong>Chip</strong>, a recruit in the <strong>Implant Corps.</strong> Prove your worth to your friends and family by winning the coveted, <i>one-of-a-kind </i>implant: the <strong>Forehead Chip</strong>. Explore city locations, interact with characters across the social divide, and pick your choices to determine the future of <strong>Arca City</strong>. Thrive and conquer, or is there another path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because once you dent the shiny surface of your implant access chip, everything is not as it seems\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/f7a7d5cd4a4bb603b3e3977506738521.webp?t=1757471368\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.poster.avif?t=1757471368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.webm?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/c46def5d6c89dd9f7a1d7ce2412b2773.mp4?t=1757471368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skills, tactics, and trigger-conscious precision against enemies and obstacles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, tuned, responsive controls.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+</strong> types of enemies to fight and capture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different <strong>districts</strong> (biomes) to dropship into.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap rewards on your <strong>upgrade tablet</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover thorny <strong>level secrets</strong> and unlock new game modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171910/extras/541491b535de1a80a9f